docs/design-notes.md-4242-## Projected Streams Snapshot Enrichment (2026-08-12)
docs/design-notes.md-4243-
docs/design-notes.md-4244-`stream_state` checkpoint/delta is the source of historical lifecycle state, but it does not contain interface inventory or sampled bitrate. For a projected `/api/streams?time=` response, the server therefore combines lifecycle state at the requested time with the latest raw metrics snapshot at or before that time. This keeps Dashboard historical Streams consistent with the selected event while avoiding duplicated metrics in the lifecycle journal.
